Subject: Evidence Hash Parameter Join Invocation Fault

@ [fault_uuid] 2256e60e-b0f9-4e59-b56e-c3af799dcd39
@ [observed_at_unix_ms] 1785980779346

& [Operation] was read-only hashing of two evidence manifests during dependency-DAG refresh
& [Fault] omitted whitespace joined a path variable and Algorithm parameter and produced two PowerShell binding errors
& [Pattern] repeats the earlier I03E2 source-check invocation fault and therefore requires an explicit local mitigation
& [Containment] empty hash outputs were rejected and no manifest edit used them
& [Correction] reran both hashes with LiteralPath and Algorithm as separate named parameters
& [Mitigation] all remaining Get-FileHash calls in this turn use the full named-parameter form
& [Impact] none beyond invalid diagnostic output and lost time
